](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/46) supplies validation. Draft [PR #50](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/50) adds installed source/discovery/manifest generation and handoff, with 105 passing tests, green GitHub checks and an actual installed archived-source/export/SDK proof. Both are open/unmerged. [Results](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/blob/8053eb2c/experiments/48-generation-manifest/installed-results.md). Fresh native execution through this installed path remains unproven; no extra model call/job/spend was used for extraction.\n\n**Scientific findings:** #45 generated one known Cobrapy PR #1497 package with 11 original calls/$0.287646, followed by an APT reconstruction failure. #47’s explicit generic policy recovered builds but original 300-second controls timed out; null rewards disagree with late files. #49 preserved that evidence, verified anonymous readback and cleaned owned resources without accepting/regrading it. All owned jobs are terminal. No independently accepted fresh pair or clean command is established.\n\n**Next:** subissue #51 now has a source-bound automatic retention candidate: 35 tests and actual archived-failure HF/readback proof with unchanged scientific holds, evidence and budget. [Results](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/blob/6bff8b47/experiments/51-held-retention/results.md). Installed extraction and serial-loop integration remain; fresh native execution through the installed path and an independently accepted fresh pair are still unproven. Do not regenerate known references merely to exercise an interface.\n\n**Coverage/budget:** original #28 stays at 83 exports, 82 ever-positive, 67 ever-clean; 25 public-eligible and 58 Matchms withheld. A reproduced package is not a new unique task. Epic actual is 9.596001/32 CPUh, zero CPU reservations, $0.287646 provider cost and $10 existing archival reserve unreconciled. Operating ceiling $90, strictly below $100 extra; no new capacity.\n\nKeep #28 closed and epic/children open for review. Concise status here, detailed logs/eligible append-only HF receipts in comments. Retain protected evidence/research branches. No automatic merge or dataset release.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}